#: 36abc66b9d8a495fb43fe088bd8da391
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on the UART6 and supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. The SBUS pin is inverted and connected to RX6."
msgstr "默认 RC 输入配置在 UART6，支持除 PPM 外的所有 RC 协议。SBUS 引脚经反相后连接至 RX6。"

