#: ff67a6d48f3c460d8017ee466948128c
msgid ""
"RC can be attached to any UART port as long as the serial port protocol is "
"set to ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL=23`` and SERIAL6_Protocol is changed to something "
"other than '23'."
msgstr ""
"RC 可连接至任意 UART 端口，只要串口协议设置为 ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL=23`` 且 SERIAL6_Protocol 更改为非 "
"'23' 的值。"

