#: ../../source/docs/common-AET-H743-Basic.rst:161
#: e51dfe6311fc4128b697129064166c94
msgid "Bluetooth"
msgstr "蓝牙"

#: ../../source/docs/common-AET-H743-Basic.rst:162
#: 5a50083f429341a3bc5110fd637b8979
msgid ""
"The AET-H743-Basic support both legacy bluetooth SPP and BLE serial. The "
"bluetooth uses UART7 as serial port. Search for ``AET-H743-SPP`` or "
"``AET-H743-BLE`` to connect."
msgstr ""
"AET-H743-Basic 同时支持传统蓝牙 SPP 和 BLE 串口。蓝牙使用 UART7 作为串口，搜索 ``AET-H743-SPP`` 或 "
"``AET-H743-BLE`` 进行连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-AET-H743-Basic.rst:164
#: 4e099e1b7a7743469ffb6d6a94ad3f01
msgid ""
"Note: you need to connect a battery to the board to power the bluetooth "
"module."
msgstr "注意：需要连接电池为飞控板供电才能启动蓝牙模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-AET-H743-Basic.rst:167
#: 99b21c481be54abf81acd1a38d6c8715
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-AET-H743-Basic.rst:168
#: a3d73bce7e9c4f2a9c71b05ecae249f9
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favorite DFU loading tool, such as Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"初始固件可通过 DFU 方式加载：按住引导程序按钮同时插入 USB，然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 工具（如 Mission Planner）加载 "
"'with_bl.hex' 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-AET-H743-Basic.rst:170
#: c7caca95cfa84715af9c3784db52bb42
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"\"\\*.apj\" firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可通过任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件，更新时使用 '*.apj' 固件文件。"
